# Canonical route: the page's fastest path. Any starting zone 1-70
# (Durotar for Horde, Elwynn Forest for Alliance), Silverpine Forest
# for Horde and Loch Modan for Alliance 70-115, Hillsbrad Foothills
# 115-170, Stranglethorn Vale 170-205, Tanaris 205-230, the Hinterlands
# 230-270, Felwood 270-300. Learn Artisan before Tanaris or Searing
# Gorge: neither zone has a trainer.
#
# The page's routes are drawn lines on map images, so every loop here is
# built from the reference data instead: herb spawn centroids from
# objects.json, clustered per band (derive_coords.py), cross-checked
# against the zones and herbs the page names. The page's routes from
# 170 up are Classic routes the author could not test on live (the beta
# cap was 30); the loops still follow the data's densest spawns.
#
# NPC ids resolved from the reference data (npcs.json, professions.json
# rank trainer lists):
#   Trainers: Nancy Songflower 247223 (Elwynn), Zor'la 267329 (Valley
#   of Trials), Reyna Stonebranch 5137 (Ironforge), Jandi 3404
#   (Orgrimmar). The starting-zone trainers teach Apprentice only,
#   matching the page; the capital trainers teach every rank.
# Skill needed per herb (from the page and the shipped reference):
# Peacebloom, Silverleaf 1, Earthroot 15, Mageroyal 50, Briarthorn 70,
# Stranglekelp 85, Bruiseweed 100, Wild Steelbloom 115, Kingsblood 125,
# Liferoot 150, Fadeleaf 160, Goldthorn 170, Khadgar's Whisker 185,
# Firebloom 205, Purple Lotus 210, Sungrass 230, Ghost Mushroom 245,
# Gromsblood 250, Golden Sansam 260, Dreamfoil 270, Mountain Silversage
# 280, Plaguebloom 285.
guide forever-professions/herbalism
title Herbalism 1-300
category Professions
coords era
levels 1-60
zone Azeroth

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice

section Herbalism 1-70

step Learn Herbalism
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Herbalism takes one of your two primary profession slots (gathering pairs cleanly with Alchemy or funds crafting via Scarce herbs like Frilled Lichen, Rosecap and Stranglevine). Nancy Songflower in Elwynn Forest teaches Apprentice Herbalism at any character level. Turn on Find Herbs once you have learned it: it is in the Herbalism box of the Professions window, and it is off by default. Drag it to your action bar; it switches off every time you die, and you can only track herbs or minerals, not both.
  train Herbalism Apprentice npc 247223

step Learn Herbalism
  only Horde
  zone Durotar
  tip Herbalism takes one of your two primary profession slots (gathering pairs cleanly with Alchemy or funds crafting via Scarce herbs like Frilled Lichen, Rosecap and Stranglevine). Zor'la in the Valley of Trials teaches Apprentice Herbalism at any character level. Turn on Find Herbs once you have learned it: it is in the Herbalism box of the Professions window, and it is off by default. Drag it to your action bar; it switches off every time you die, and you can only track herbs or minerals, not both.
  train Herbalism Apprentice npc 267329

step Peacebloom and Silverleaf in Durotar
  only Horde
  zone Durotar
  tip Pick every Peacebloom, Silverleaf and Earthroot you pass and circle the waypoints until Herbalism 70; Earthroot needs skill 15. Forever's starting areas also grow Wilted Peacebloom and Stunted Silverleaf, both pickable from skill 1. Herbs come back so fast here that you often cannot finish a full lap before they regrow. Any starting zone works for this band.
  goto 42.2,62.6 "Wilted Peacebloom, Stunted Silverleaf" r 30
  goto 46.2,62.7 "Wilted Peacebloom, Stunted Silverleaf" r 30
  goto 46.5,58.3 "Wilted Peacebloom, Stunted Silverleaf" r 30
  goto 43.0,58.0 "Wilted Peacebloom, Stunted Silverleaf" r 30
  goto 43.6,66.8 "Wilted Peacebloom, Stunted Silverleaf" r 30
  goto 46.9,68.2 "Wilted Peacebloom, Stunted Silverleaf" r 30
  goto 43.3,72.3 "Wilted Peacebloom, Stunted Silverleaf" r 30
  goto 52.3,57.9 "Silverleaf, Peacebloom" r 30
  goto 41.4,48.0 "Silverleaf, Peacebloom" r 30
  goto 47.6,37.1 "Silverleaf, Peacebloom" r 30
  goto 36.8,28.4 "Peacebloom, Earthroot" r 30
  goto 57.1,22.4 "Silverleaf, Peacebloom" r 30
  skill Herbalism 70

