# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Herbalism 70-115

section Herbalism 70-115

step Journeyman Herbalism
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Journeyman Herbalism raises the cap to 150 and needs skill 50. Reyna Stonebranch in Ironforge teaches it.
  train Herbalism Journeyman npc 5137

step Journeyman Herbalism
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Journeyman Herbalism raises the cap to 150 and needs skill 50. Jandi in Orgrimmar teaches it.
  train Herbalism Journeyman npc 3404

step Mageroyal and Briarthorn in Silverpine Forest
  only Horde
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Mageroyal and Briarthorn are the skill-up herbs here, with Stranglekelp along the shore from 85. The lower part of Silverpine regrows fast enough to run small circles; with a mount, run the main road up to the loop. Stranglekelp grows underwater, so watch your breath.
  goto 62.1,77.2 "Briarthorn" r 30
  goto 51.8,78.0 "Briarthorn" r 30
  goto 52.0,72.6 "Mageroyal, Briarthorn" r 30
  goto 47.2,81.3 "Mageroyal, Briarthorn" r 30
  goto 41.4,72.0 "Stranglekelp, Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 52.7,56.0 "Briarthorn, Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 52.0,36.9 "Mageroyal, Briarthorn" r 30
  goto 48.7,32.5 "Briarthorn, Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 47.1,27.2 "Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 57.3,18.5 "Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 62.8,12.2 "Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 31.8,16.8 "Stranglekelp, Mageroyal" r 30
  skill Herbalism 115

step Mageroyal and Briarthorn in Loch Modan
  only Alliance
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Mageroyal and Briarthorn are the skill-up herbs here. The Loch Modan loop is an easy one, with slightly fewer herbs than Darkshore; Darkshore is the alternative if the loch is picked clean.
  goto 77.6,71.7 "Briarthorn" r 30
  goto 67.0,72.9 "Mageroyal, Briarthorn" r 30
  goto 69.1,51.2 "Mageroyal, Briarthorn" r 30
  goto 53.5,36.7 "Briarthorn" r 30
  goto 53.1,26.6 "Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 57.5,16.4 "Briarthorn, Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 41.3,31.4 "Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 40.4,37.5 "Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 40.8,42.3 "Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 38.0,45.6 "Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 30.6,53.0 "Mageroyal" r 30
  goto 26.9,47.3 "Mageroyal" r 30
  skill Herbalism 115

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Herbalism 115-170

section Herbalism 115-170

step Bruiseweed and Wild Steelbloom in Hillsbrad Foothills
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Bruiseweed and Wild Steelbloom are the skill-up herbs here, with Stranglekelp along the shore and Kingsblood from 125. The loop is long enough to give the herbs time to regrow. Stonetalon Mountains is the alternative: its lowest area has the gentlest mobs, around level 14 to 15.
  goto 67.5,37.6 "Liferoot, Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 63.6,37.6 "Liferoot, Kingsblood" r 30
  goto 67.3,32.2 "Liferoot, Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 68.0,27.9 "Liferoot" r 30
  goto 72.4,28.0 "Bruiseweed, Kingsblood" r 30
  goto 81.4,32.3 "Bruiseweed, Kingsblood" r 30
  goto 87.3,32.4 "Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 64.1,53.6 "Bruiseweed, Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 57.9,46.9 "Liferoot" r 30
  goto 38.3,51.9 "Kingsblood, Bruiseweed" r 30
  goto 67.9,67.9 "Bruiseweed, Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 71.6,62.6 "Bruiseweed, Kingsblood" r 30
  skill Herbalism 125

step Expert Herbalism
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Expert Herbalism raises the cap to 225 and needs skill 125. Reyna Stonebranch in Ironforge teaches it.
  train Herbalism Expert npc 5137

step Expert Herbalism
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Expert Herbalism raises the cap to 225 and needs skill 125. Jandi in Orgrimmar teaches it.
  train Herbalism Expert npc 3404

step Kingsblood and Liferoot in Hillsbrad Foothills cont.
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Keep circling the same loop to 170: Kingsblood from 125, Liferoot from 150. If you get stuck between two herbs, a skill bonus bridges the gap: Herbalist's Gloves add 5, the Advanced Herbalism glove enchant adds 5, and Goldthorn Tea adds 15. With +5 you can pick Kingsblood from 120 instead of 125.
  goto 67.5,37.6 "Liferoot, Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 63.6,37.6 "Liferoot, Kingsblood" r 30
  goto 67.3,32.2 "Liferoot, Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 68.0,27.9 "Liferoot" r 30
  goto 72.4,28.0 "Bruiseweed, Kingsblood" r 30
  goto 81.4,32.3 "Bruiseweed, Kingsblood" r 30
  goto 87.3,32.4 "Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 64.1,53.6 "Bruiseweed, Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 57.9,46.9 "Liferoot" r 30
  goto 38.3,51.9 "Kingsblood, Bruiseweed" r 30
  goto 67.9,67.9 "Bruiseweed, Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 71.6,62.6 "Bruiseweed, Kingsblood" r 30
  skill Herbalism 170

