# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Herbalism 205-230

section Herbalism 205-230

step Artisan Herbalism
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Artisan Herbalism raises the cap to 300 and needs skill 200. Train it now, before heading out: there is no Herbalism trainer in Tanaris or Searing Gorge. Reyna Stonebranch in Ironforge teaches it.
  train Herbalism Artisan npc 5137

step Artisan Herbalism
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Artisan Herbalism raises the cap to 300 and needs skill 200. Train it now, before heading out: there is no Herbalism trainer in Tanaris or Searing Gorge. Jandi in Orgrimmar teaches it.
  train Herbalism Artisan npc 3404

