step Sungrass and Purple Lotus in the Hinterlands
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Sungrass, Purple Lotus, Ghost Mushroom and Golden Sansam are the skill-up herbs here. Ghost Mushroom grows in caves and dark hollows, and you need skill 245 to pick it; the cave on the page's map holds a lot of them.
